  "rationale": "DDR-focused library (1145 genes, 992 non-targeting guides). Counts built by prepare.R: per-sample GEO files list reads per guide and lineage barcode, summed per guide and merged. The paper compares TNG348- (or olaparib-) treated with DMSO-treated cells after 10 population doublings; resistance knockouts (RAD18, USP1 pathway) enrich and sensitizers (PARP1) deplete under TNG348, while PARP1 loss enriches under olaparib. UWB1.289 has one library per arm (no-replicate path, screening-level calls). MDA-MB-436 has two DMSO cultures and one TNG348 culture (1 residual df).",
